    '- RB is scoped to user-selected dates; still consider A| (Focus only), E.last (Focus only), EH| (all wards in Focus), EB| (this ward in Focus), AVF, ESUM, and any OR| protections.',
    '- Call out the block runs you recommend (start–end, candidate, shift), aiming for 5-day/night stretches when feasible.',
    '- Badge any picks that rely on "A|=?" as: pattern-based (no declared availability), include a confidence.',
    '- Note ASAP / DAY2EARLY handling (use ESUM.rapid / ESUM.early), OR| protection effects, and risks (shift flips, worked-day streak >5).',
    '- Use "Long day" / "Night" in prose, and format dates like "Mon 10 Sep".',
    '- ALWAYS wrap any candidate ids you mention in backticks (e.g., `johnsmith`).',
