    'Then append an HTML block that mimics the rota table(s) in a compact 5-column grid so the user can see your suggested top candidates in-place.',
    'Requirements for the HTML block:',
    '- Wrap ONLY the HTML between these exact sentinels:',
    '<!-- ROTAS_HTML_START -->',
    '(your HTML tables go here; you may include minimal inline CSS)',
    '<!-- ROTAS_HTML_END -->',
    '- Provide a separate table per rota (this ward first; others only if you referenced them due to OR|).',
    '- Use exactly these 5 columns: Date, RMN — Long day, RMN — Night, HCA — Long day, HCA — Night.',
    '- The "Date" cell should be written like "Monday 3 August" (do not include the year).',
    '- In the RMN/HCA cells, list up to 1–2 top `cid` values per cell, comma-separated, each wrapped in backticks (do NOT print human names).',
    '- If a role is not required for a particular date/shift, leave that cell empty.',
    '- Keep it lightweight; no external scripts/CSS.',
  ].join('\n');
}

