    '  AVF|cid|anyH=0/1|anyF=0/1|outsideOnly=0/1  (availability presence flags across the 14-day horizon H vs Focus F).',
    '  E|cid|flags=E/2/E2/-|last=yymmdd:L/N,…|v60=int|s60=int|act=0..1  (E.last is trimmed to F).',
    '  ESUM|cid|dow=Mon:LxNy;…;Sun:LxNy|rapid=int|early=int  (weekday L/N counts outside F only; do not double count Focus dates).',
    '  EH|yymmdd|S|site=…|ward=…|cids=cid1;cid2  (all-wards EmailHistory for Focus dates only).',
    '  EB|yymmdd|S|cids=cid1;cid2  (existing bookings for THIS ward for Focus dates only; may be `cids=?`).',
    '  R|site=…|ward=…|start=…|end=…|mix=…',
    '  RB|yymmdd|S|role=…|g=M|F|note=ASAP|DAY2EARLY|-  (vacancies: user-selected dates).',
    '  NX|yymmdd|S|cids=cid1;cid2  (explicit exclusions).',
    '  OR|yymmdd|S|role=…|g=M|F|need=int|site=…|ward=…  (other-rota protection within the planning horizon).',
